### REST Client (VS Code) / IntelliJ HTTP Client
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@date = 2030-01-02
@adminToken = paste-admin-token
@doctorToken = paste-doctor-token
@doctorId = 1
@appointmentId = 1
@appointmentCode = paste-booking-code

# ==============================================================================
# 1. PUBLIC APIS
# ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Thong tin phong kham
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clinic

### 1.2 Danh sach dich vu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services

### 1.3 Danh sach bac si dang hoat dong
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors

### 1.4 Chi tiet 1 bac si
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/{{doctorId}}

### 1.5 Cac khung gio con trong cua bac si theo ngay & dich vu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/{{doctorId}}/available-slots?date={{date}}&serviceId=2

### 1.6 Dat lich hen moi (PENDING - khach khong chon bac si)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "email": "patient@example.com",
  "serviceId": 2,
  "preferredDate": "{{date}}",
  "preferredTime": "09:00",
  "note": "Kham tong quat va lay cao rang"
}

### 1.7 Tra cuu lich hen theo booking code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentCode}}

### 1.8 Khach hang huy lich hen theo booking code
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentCode}}


# ==============================================================================
# 2. AUTH APIS
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Dang nhap Admin (Sao chep accessToken vao @adminToken o tren)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 2.2 Dang nhap Bac si (Sao chep accessToken vao @doctorToken o tren)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "doctor1",
  "password": "Doctor123!"
}

### 2.3 Xem thong tin tai khoan hien tai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2.4 Dang xuat (Thu hoi token ngay lap tuc)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


# ==============================================================================
# 3. ADMIN APIS (10 ENDPOINTS)
# ==============================================================================

### 3.1 [Admin] Xem tat ca lich hen he thong
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.2 [Admin] Xem chi tiet 1 lich hen theo ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.3 [Admin] Phan cong bac si va gio kham (chuyen sang ASSIGNED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": {{doctorId}},
  "appointmentDate": "{{date}}",
  "startTime": "09:00"
}

### 3.4 [Admin] Doi trang thai lich hen (vi du: CANCELLED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

### 3.5 [Admin] Xem danh sach toan bo bac si (bao gom ca da vo hieu hoa)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.6 [Admin] Tao tai khoan va ho so bac si moi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "doctor3",
  "password": "Doctor123!",
  "fullName": "Bac si Le Hoang",
  "specialization": "Chinh nha - Nieng rang",
  "phone": "0900000003",
  "email": "doctor3@example.com",
  "description": "Chuyen gia chinh nha 10 nam kinh nghiem"
}

### 3.7 [Admin] Xem chi tiet ho so 1 bac si
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/doctors/{{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.8 [Admin] Cap nhat ho so bac si
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/doctors/{{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bac si Nguyen An (Cap nhat)",
  "specialization": "Nha khoa tong quat & Tham my",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "email": "doctor1_updated@example.com",
  "description": "Tot nghiep Dai hoc Y Duoc"
}

### 3.9 [Admin] Vo hieu hoa tai khoan bac si (Soft delete, chan neu con lich mo)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/doctors/{{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.10 [Admin] Xem toan bo lich hen cua 1 bac si
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/doctors/{{doctorId}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


# ==============================================================================
# 4. DOCTOR APIS
# ==============================================================================

### 4.1 [Doctor] Xem danh sach lich hen duoc phan cong cho minh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 4.2 [Doctor] Xem chi tiet 1 lich hen cua minh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 4.3 [Doctor] Xac nhan lich hen (ASSIGNED -> CONFIRMED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### 4.4 [Doctor] Hoan thanh ca kham (CONFIRMED -> COMPLETED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 4.5 [Doctor] Xem thong tin ho so cua minh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 4.6 [Doctor] Cap nhat ho so cua minh
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bac si Nguyen An",
  "specialization": "Nha khoa tong quat chuyen sau",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "email": "doctor1@example.com",
  "description": "Thong tin cap nhat boi bac si"
}


# ==============================================================================
# 5. OPENAPI 3 / SWAGGER UI DOCS
# ==============================================================================

### 5.1 OpenAPI Specification JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### 5.2 Swagger UI HTML (Mo tren trinh duyet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html
